'''Calem''' (Japanese: '''カルム''' ''Calme'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Draw a card for each {{TCGP|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} in play ''(both yours and your opponent's)''.
}}

