==Trivia==
This card's effect is similar to {{TCG|Jett}} from the physical {{PTCG}}, though this card draws for every Mega Evolution Pokémon ex in play, rather than just the opponent's.
===Origin===
*{{ga|Calem}} is the male [[player character]] in {{g|X and Y}}.

